--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- three-section composite mooring: chain + polyester + chain, static IC
-- A chain-polyester-chain arrangement: a short studless chain at the fairlead (handling), a long
-- polyester mid-section (compliance / weight saving), and a chain at the anchor (touchdown / grip).
-- One LINE, three SECTIONS in End-A(fairlead)->End-B(anchor) order. Polyester uses a linear-EA
-- approximation (the Syrope working-curve model is a separate advanced dialect). 200 m depth.
--   chain 155 mm R4 studless: volume-equivalent diam 0.2791 m, dry mass 480.93 kg/m, EA 2.058e9 N.
--   polyester 181.8 mm: diam 0.1438 m, dry mass 22.42 kg/m, static EA 1.42e8 N (net-heavy).
